## 3. Configuration & Parameter Targets
Your configuration files or environment files (.env) must explicitly enforce these bounds to keep the JIT-like cache cycles stable:

| Variable Parameter | Recommended Value | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| LM_STUDIO_BASE_URL | http://localhost:1234/v1 | Points Go app to local API target rather than cloud OpenAI |
| MAX_CONCURRENT_LLM_JOBS | 2 (Adjust based on VRAM) | Protects GPU hardware from thrashing and out-of-memory errors |
| MAX_CONTEXT_TOKENS | 4096 | Upper limit of text history sent to Gemma 4 per request |
| SESSION_TTL_SECONDS | 86400 (24 Hours) | Evicts old history logs from database cache to save server space |

